Article 10 (Standard of Certification of Fire Equipment) Certification of fire equipment shall comply with each of the following standards (hereinafter referred to as “certification standard”): <Amended on Jan. 5, 2021; May 15, 2023>
  1. Product examination standard: standards for the structure, functions, properties, conditions, and performance, etc. of fire equipment, in compliance with the basic specifications;
  2. Place examination standard: standards concerning the manufacturing facilities and testing facilities for fire equipment, their personnel, and the quality management system, as determined and publicly notified by the Fire Commissioner of the National Fire Agency.
